<title>BULGARIA: NATIONAL BANK OF MACEDONIA FIX FOR THURSDAY.</title>
<headline>NATIONAL BANK OF MACEDONIA FIX FOR THURSDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA, SKOPJE 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Macedonia (NBM) fix for Thursday:</p>
<p>    DEM 100 - 2,663.3929	USD   1 -  40.6221</p>
<p>    CHF 100 - 3,147.3314	ATS 100 - 378.4681</p>
<p>The NBM calculates the denar's rate against the German mark on the basis of the information submitted by banks during the morning. Denar rates against other currencies are worked out from the Frankfurt fixing rates, issued around 1500 local time.</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
